        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Here’s a **clear, calm, and professional draft** you can send. I’ve kept it factual and non-confrontational while documenting what happened and why you shared the photos.\n\n:::writing{id=\"84217\" variant=\"email\" subject=\"Update on Elevator Access, Furniture Removal, and Bed Bug Treatment\"}\nDear [Property Manager’s Name],\n\nI am writing to document the current situation since yesterday.\n\nYesterday, I went down to the management office to request elevator key access so I could remove and dispose of my household belongings following the bed bug inspection. This was done in response to the inspection findings and the direction provided by management, despite the inspection being limited in nature.\n\nAs instructed, I have begun removing items from my unit in preparation for the treatment scheduled for tomorrow. I have also attached the current photos to ensure there is clarity regarding the condition of the unit and to confirm that treatment can proceed as required by management.\n\nPlease note that these steps were taken under direction and time pressure, and I am making every effort to comply fully so there are no delays with tomorrow’s treatment.\n\nKindly confirm that the treatment will proceed as scheduled and advise if any further actions are required from my side.\n\nThank you for your attention to this matter.\n\nSincerely,  \nAmit Puri\n:::\n\nIf you want, I can:\n- Make it **more firm/legal**\n- Add **cost concerns or out-of-pocket language**\n- Reframe it to **protect you in case of future disputes**\n\nJust tell me the tone you want 👍"
          ]
        },
